flowchart TB
    Source["候選原始碼／PR head<br/>Candidate source as data"] --> Run
    Trust["受信任基準／政策／RoE<br/>Trusted baseline / policy / RoE"] --> Run
    subgraph Evaluator["可信評估端 / Trusted evaluator"]
        Run["supervisor／限額 worker<br/>Registered, bounded execution"] --> Scan["G1：來源／SBOM／OSV；G2：機密<br/>Provenance / SCA / secret scanning"]
        Scan --> Oracle["AUTH：44 案例、完整副作用與延遲變動<br/>44 cases / full state / delayed writes"]
        Oracle --> Decision["確定性判定／故障即阻擋<br/>Deterministic ALLOW / BLOCK"]
        Decision --> Report["摘要綁定與清理證據<br/>Bound report and cleanup"]
    end
    Oracle <-->|"HTTP bridge／獨立 DB 查核<br/>Independent database checks"| Isolation["隔離 app／DB：無網路、限權與限額<br/>Networkless, bounded containers"]
    subgraph Models["獨立模型路徑 / Independent advisory path"]
        Cases["固定合成案例／不含答案<br/>Fixed blind synthetic cases"] --> Gateway["呼叫前預留／有限額循序呼叫<br/>Durable reservations / bounded calls"]
        Gateway --> Cloud["Gemini／Claude Sonnet<br/>v2 已驗收；v3 待真實驗收<br/>v2 accepted; v3 live pending"]
        Gateway --> Local["LM Studio／Nemotron 文字介面<br/>Offline tested; live pending<br/>離線完成；真實端點待驗收"]
        Gateway -.-> GLM["GLM：真實連線暫停<br/>Live connection paused"]
        Cloud --> Score["嚴格驗證／本機評分／分批比較<br/>Strict validation / local scoring / batch comparison"]
        Local --> Score
        Score --> Advisory["僅供參考，不決定閘門<br/>Advisory only; no gate authority"]
    end
    Source ~~~ Cases
    Report --> CI["正式 CI／最新 head 獨立核准<br/>Formal CI / independent exact-head approval"]
    CI --> Signed["獨立 runner 簽署 ZIP 摘要<br/>Separate artifact attestation job"]
    Signed --> Final["評估與簽章全成功才放行<br/>Final check requires both jobs successful"]
    Final --> Rules["main 規則啟用／無 bypass<br/>Active rules; shared Actions source"]
    Signed -.-> Publisher["專用發布器程式已備妥，尚未部署<br/>Dedicated publisher prepared, not deployed"]
    Publisher -.->|"待綁定專用 App<br/>Dedicated source binding pending"| Rules
    classDef pending fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#a67822,stroke-dasharray:5 5;
    class GLM,Publisher pending;
